      <Comment>|FRAME: THIAZOL-YL-INDOLE Camalexin| is the main phytoalexin in |FRAME: TAX-3702|. It is involved in plant defense and has cancer-preventive properties. The accumulation of camalexin is induced by an attack by a variety of microorganisms including bacteria, fungi and oomycetes.</Comment>
